 "summary": "This is an employment agreement between Northwind Labs, Inc. and Sofia Lindqvist, effective 30 July 2025, for a Senior Data Engineer role at a $118,000 annual base salary, with at-will termination and Ontario governing law. The contract has no fixed term, and it reuses several commercial-contract clauses that fit poorly with employment."
